   * ({@link #COORDINATOR}, {@link #OVERLORD}, {@link #ROUTER}, {@link #BROKER}{@link #INDEXER},
   * {@link #MIDDLE_MANAGER}, {@link #HISTORICAL}) instead of constructing a new instance.
